# Optional: Direct Gmail SMTP Configuration
# If you want emails sent directly via your Google Account without third-party forwarders:
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App Passwords
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password for "Mail"
# 3. Copy .env.example to .env.local and fill in the values below:

GMAIL_USER=piyushsingh99899@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_char_app_password

# If left blank, the portfolio automatically uses the instant FormSubmit forwarding service to piyushsingh99899@gmail.com
